<Program Use="Context" Name="MainProgram">
<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Target" Name="Memory_Data" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================================================================================================
Memory Informations : read the PLC Memory Informations

List of treatments handled by the routine :
- Calculation Memory Datas

                                                    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
History 
		2021-Nov-17 - Merck - Q.Spindler - Initial version for Candidate Release 1.01.00.00.a
==========================================================================================================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This rung takes the data that is returned from the User Memory Object and places it into a User Define Data Type or easy of viewing.
The reason why we must multiple the returned data by 4 is because the dat is the number of 32 bit words of memory used.  We spec memory by bytes, so we must multiple by 4 to get memory in bytes.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[COP(Memory_Temp[3],Memory_Data.Free_Mem_IO,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Free_Mem_IO,4,Memory_Data.Free_Mem_IO) ,COP(Memory_Temp[5],Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT,4,Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT) ,COP(Memory_Temp[7],Memory_Data.Free_Mem_Gen,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Free_Mem_Gen,4,Memory_Data.Free_Mem_Gen) ,CPT(Memory_Data.Free_Memory,Memory_Data.Free_Mem_Gen+Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT+Memory_Data.Free_Mem_IO) ,COP(Memory_Temp[11],Memory_Data.Total_Mem_IO,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Total_Mem_IO,4,Memory_Data.Total_Mem_IO) ,COP(Memory_Temp[13],Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT,4,Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT) ,COP(Memory_Temp[15],Memory_Data.Total_Mem_Gen,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Total_Mem_Gen,4,Memory_Data.Total_Mem_Gen) ,CPT(Memory_Data.Total_Memory,Memory_Data.Total_Mem_Gen+Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT+Memory_Data.Total_Mem_IO) ,COP(Memory_Temp[19],Memory_Data.Biggest_Gen_Mem_Size_Ava,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Biggest_Gen_Mem_Size_Ava,4,Memory_Data.Biggest_Gen_Mem_Size_Ava) ,COP(Memory_Temp[23],Memory_Data.Biggest_IO_Mem_Size_Ava,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Biggest_IO_Mem_Size_Ava,4,Memory_Data.Biggest_IO_Mem_Size_Ava) ,COP(Memory_Temp[27],Memory_Data.Biggest_DT_Mem_Size_Ava,1) MUL(Memory_Data.Biggest_DT_Mem_Size_Ava,4,Memory_Data.Biggest_DT_Mem_Size_Ava) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Convert the Total Memory and Free Memory in Real format]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[MOV(Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT,Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT_Real) ,MOV(Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT,Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT_Real) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculation of Used Memeory and Percentage Used Memory]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[SUB(Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT_Real,Memory_Data.Free_Mem_DT_Real,Memory_Data.Used_Mem_DT_Real) ,CPT(Memory_Data.Percentage_Used_DT,Memory_Data.Used_Mem_DT_Real/Memory_Data.Total_Mem_DT_Real*100) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
